  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [sinon](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon) from `v4.1.2` to `v4.1.3`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>sinonjs/sinon</summary>\n\n#### 4.1.3\n-   [`39b0849`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/39b0849ee3c65b34c582a613a50c5f6b10474220) Update docs/changelog.md and set new release id in docs/_config.yml\n-   [`6f9af25`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/6f9af25798f72d0de16445d5ed91eaaac1a9fd29) 4.1.3\n-   [`c6bd1de`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/c6bd1decea40c0c57c58956ce5363f1682992ec7) Update History.md and AUTHORS for new release\n-   [`911c498`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/911c498dc14dc4034ba019526bf58f8b24d77da0) Spy passes through calling with `new` (#&#8203;1626)\n-   [`271d84a`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/271d84a194493d7e4d76d862bb719ca366cc2cba) Update external_howtos.yml\n-   [`e96ff8c`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/e96ff8c5a360dc8153b2f86d4391bfb40a6bb4aa) CircleCI Integration (#&#8203;1479)\n-   [`88e9132`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/88e91327024f52cf5a04f74a77c68451d24f2930) Upgrade type-detect dependency to 4.0.5\n-   [`45c4d57`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/45c4d576ea0dfa09742f2ea09c0821d514f0f157) Move yieldsAsync* documentation to the first yieldsAsync*\n-   [`8c54024`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/8c5402441309d6c01c13de3fd9fd54078b8452b0) Remove sinon.restore(object|method) from v3.x+ docs\n-   [`9ae6f73`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/9ae6f73c6fbeaae8e701afa7eba7597099c51748) Remove sinon.log from 2.x+ docs\n-   [`0111ed0`](https://github.com/sinonjs/sinon/commit/0111ed0eda7acd319f8af4b4a47d3862ac5e1885) Update markdownlinter-cli to official v0.4.0\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
